{"title": "Hear the Finest Shanties at the Blushing Mermaid", "pageid": 39647, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Hear_the_Finest_Shanties_at_the_Blushing_Mermaid", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:BaldursMouth_ArticleBlock_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/BaldursMouth_ArticleBlock_Faded.png/300px-BaldursMouth_ArticleBlock_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/f6/BaldursMouth_ArticleBlock_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Hear the Finest Shanties at the Blushing Mermaid image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/BaldursMouth_ArticleBlock_Faded.png/300px-BaldursMouth_ArticleBlock_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/BaldursMouth_ArticleBlock_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Hear the Finest Shanties at the Blushing Mermaid</b> is a common <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">miscellaneous</a> item which can be used in the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Stop_the_Presses\" title=\"Stop the Presses\">Stop the Presses</a>.\n\nThis article about the hum-drum of Baldur's Gate doesn't talk about your arrival in the city.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Descrip